# Operator scratch notes that have historically contained the live
# QT_WEBHOOK_SECRET in plaintext (it is pasted into example curl commands).
# One `git add -A` would otherwise commit the order-submission credential.
tradingview-readme.yaml
*-readme.yaml
*.secrets
*.secret
